    "title": "Working With UA: Launch, Feedback, and Next Batches",
    "description": "You should be able to collaborate with UA as part of one learning system: understand the creative information that must travel with an asset, interpret performance feedback without overreacting, and translate a useful observation into the next batch of work.",
